message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the archive and the paper."
title: "porok: damage-induced permeability from phase-field fracture and FFT-Galerkin homogenization"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Romero Suárez"
    given-names: "German Orlando"
    affiliation: "Universidad Industrial de Santander, Bucaramanga, Colombia"
    email: german2218069@correo.uis.edu.co
  - family-names: "Villegas Bermúdez"
    given-names: "Diego Fernando"
    affiliation: "Universidad Industrial de Santander, Bucaramanga, Colombia"
  - family-names: "Velilla Díaz"
