    affiliation: "Universidad de La Serena, La Serena, Chile"
keywords:
  - damage mechanics
  - permeability
  - phase-field fracture
  - FFT homogenization
  - reservoir geomechanics
abstract: >-
  Periodic-cell reference coupling phase-field fracture under crack-length
  control to FFT-Galerkin homogenization of Darcy flow, used to bound scalar
  and second-order-tensor damage-permeability closures without fitting, and to
  place the cubic law and the Oda-Snow tensor relative to percolation.
